{"seq":2,"slug":"coreml-and-onnx","title":"CoreML 与 ONNX","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/coreml-and-onnx","wordCount":1085,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"coreml-与-onnx\">CoreML 与 ONNX</h1><h2 id=\"跨平台模型推理\">跨平台模型推理</h2><p>在实际部署中，模型往往需要在不同的平台和设备上运行。CoreML 和 ONNX 是两种主流的跨平台模型格式，分别针对 Apple 生态和通用推理场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;训练框架&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;PyTorch&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;TensorFlow&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;scikit-learn&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;ONNX&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;CoreML&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;ONNX Runtime&lt;br/&gt;Windows/Linux/Mac&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;TensorRT&lt;br/&gt;NVIDIA GPU&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;LiteRT&lt;br/&gt;(原 TFLite)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; J[&quot;Apple 设备&lt;br/&gt;iOS/macOS/watchOS&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"训练框架\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"PyTorch\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"TensorFlow\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"scikit-learn\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"ONNX\"]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; F[\"CoreML\"]\n    C --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G[\"ONNX Runtime&lt;br/&gt;Windows/Linux/Mac\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"TensorRT&lt;br/&gt;NVIDIA GPU\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"LiteRT&lt;br/&gt;(原 TFLite)\"]\n    F --&gt; J[\"Apple 设备&lt;br/&gt;iOS/macOS/watchOS\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨平台模型部署围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>中间表示（IR）</strong>：ONNX 定义了与训练框架无关的模型表示与算子集，使得&quot;导出一次、多处推理&quot;成为可能。模型因此不再与某个框架绑定。</li>\n<li><strong>执行提供者（Execution Provider）</strong>：同一个 ONNX 模型可以在 ONNX Runtime、TensorRT、CoreML 等不同引擎上运行，各自利用不同的硬件加速器。<strong>格式与运行时解耦</strong>是这套体系的核心价值。</li>\n<li><strong>算子集与版本漂移</strong>：opset 版本决定模型能用哪些算子，而导出路径（旧 TorchScript 与新 torch.export）与 opset 都在演进。<strong>选版必须以目标推理引擎的支持范围为准</strong>，这是实践中最多坑的地方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者串成一个部署决策：<strong>ONNX 提供可移植的格式，执行提供者负责特定硬件的性能，而版本匹配决定了转化能否成功</strong>。对 Apple 设备，CoreML 是更直接的路径（对接 Neural Engine）；对 NVIDIA GPU，TensorRT 最激进。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"onnx-格式详解\">ONNX 格式详解</h2><p>ONNX（Open Neural Network Exchange）定义了一套通用的模型表示格式和算子集，使得模型可以在不同框架和推理引擎之间无缝转换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pytorch-onnx\">PyTorch → ONNX</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class ImageClassifier(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.features = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(3, 16, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1),&#10;        )&#10;        self.classifier = nn.Linear(16, num_classes)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        x = self.features(x)&#10;        x = x.view(x.size(0), -1)&#10;        return self.classifier(x)&#10;&#10;model = ImageClassifier()&#10;model.eval()&#10;&#10;dummy = torch.randn(1, 3, 224, 224)&#10;torch.onnx.export(&#10;    model, dummy, &#39;/tmp/classifier.onnx&#39;,&#10;    input_names=[&#39;image&#39;],&#10;    output_names=[&#39;logits&#39;],&#10;    dynamic_axes={&#10;        &#39;image&#39;: {0: &#39;batch_size&#39;},&#10;        &#39;logits&#39;: {0: &#39;batch_size&#39;},&#10;    },&#10;    opset_version=18,&#10;)&#10;print(&quot;ONNX 导出完成&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageClassifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, num_classes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.classifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_classes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.features(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.view(x.size(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.classifier(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ImageClassifier()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.onnx.export(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model, dummy, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/classifier.onnx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    input_names</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    output_names</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'logits'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    dynamic_axes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'image'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'batch_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'logits'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'batch_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    opset_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ONNX 导出完成\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>版本注意：</strong> 上面示例用的是基于 TorchScript 的遗留导出参数（<code>dynamic_axes</code>）。PyTorch 2.x 官方推荐的新路径是 <code>dynamo=True</code>（现已默认开启），基于 <code>torch.export</code> 并用 <code>dynamic_shapes</code> 描述动态维度，旧参数仅作兼容保留（见 <a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/onnx.html\">torch.onnx 官方文档</a>）。算子集方面，opset 13 已是 2021 年的旧版本，截至 2026 年 ONNX 1.23 文档对应的默认算子集为 opset 28（见 <a href=\"https://onnx.ai/onnx/\">onnx.ai</a>）；实际选版以目标推理引擎的支持范围为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"onnx-runtime-推理\">ONNX Runtime 推理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def onnx_inference_example():&#10;    try:&#10;        import onnxruntime as ort&#10;&#10;        session = ort.InferenceSession(&#39;/tmp/classifier.onnx&#39;)&#10;&#10;        input_info = session.get_inputs()[0]&#10;        output_info = session.get_outputs()[0]&#10;        print(f&quot;输入: name={input_info.name}, shape={input_info.shape}, type={input_info.type}&quot;)&#10;        print(f&quot;输出: name={output_info.name}, shape={output_info.shape}&quot;)&#10;&#10;        image = np.random.randn(1, 3, 224, 224).astype(np.float32)&#10;        results = session.run(None, {&#39;image&#39;: image})&#10;        print(f&quot;推理结果形状: {results[0].shape}&quot;)&#10;    except ImportError:&#10;        print(&quot;需要安装 onnxruntime: pip install onnxruntime&quot;)&#10;&#10;onnx_inference_example()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style