rch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mlmodel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ct.convert(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            traced,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            inputs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[ct.ImageType(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            convert_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mlprogram\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mlmodel.save(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/classifier.mlpackage'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CoreML 模型已保存\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ImportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"需要安装 coremltools: pip install coremltools\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">coreml_conversion_example()</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;PyTorch 模型&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;TorchScript&lt;br/&gt;torch.jit.trace&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;coremltools&lt;br/&gt;ct.convert&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;CoreML 模型&lt;br/&gt;.mlpackage&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;iOS App&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;macOS App&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;watchOS App&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"PyTorch 模型\"] --&gt; B[\"TorchScript&lt;br/&gt;torch.jit.trace\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"coremltools&lt;br/&gt;ct.convert\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"CoreML 模型&lt;br/&gt;.mlpackage\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"iOS App\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"macOS App\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"watchOS App\"]</pre><h3 id=\"coreml-优化选项\">CoreML 优化选项</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计算单元</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Neural Engine</td>\n<td>Apple 专用 AI 加速器</td>\n<td>高吞吐推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>图形处理器</td>\n<td>并行计算密集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>通用处理器</td>\n<td>兼容性最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALL</td>\n<td>自动选择最优</td>\n<td>默认推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"apple-生态的端侧-llm-mlx\">Apple 生态的端侧 LLM：MLX</h3><p>CoreML 面向的是传统模型（视觉、音频、轻量分类器）的 App 内集成；而在 Apple 芯片上运行<strong>大语言模型</strong>，社区与 Apple 官方主推的是 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx\">MLX</a></strong>——一个专为 Apple silicon 统一内存架构设计的开源数组计算框架。配套的 <a href=\"https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-lm\">mlx-lm</a> 提供了 LLM 的量化转换、加载与生成流水线，可在 MacBook / Mac Studio 等设备上本地运行开源模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>典型用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CoreML</td>\n<td>App 内嵌模型的系统集成方案</td>\n<td>iOS/macOS App 打包 .mlpackage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLX</td>\n<td>Apple silicon 上的 LLM/研究框架</td>\n<td>mlx-lm 本地量化运行开源 LLM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"跨平台推理对比\">跨平台推理对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ONNX Runtime</th>\n<th>CoreML</th>\n<th>TensorRT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>Apple 专属</td>\n<td>NVIDIA GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>Python/C++/C#/Java</td>\n<td>Swift/ObjC/Python</td>\n<td>Python/C++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件加速</td>\n<td>CPU/GPU/NPU</td>\n<td>Neural Engine/GPU</td>\n<td>NVIDIA GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化支持</td>\n<td>INT8/FP16</td>\n<td>FP16/INT8</td>\n<td>INT8/FP16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型来源</td>\n<td>所有主流框架</td>\n<td>PyTorch/TF/ONNX</td>\n<td>ONNX/TF</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果目标是 Apple 设备，CoreML 是最优选择（充分利用 Neural Engine）。如果需要跨平台部署，ONNX + ONNX Runtime 是最通用的方案。在 NVIDIA GPU 上，TensorRT 提供最极致的推理性能。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ONNX</strong> 是跨框架模型交换的开放标准，配合 ONNX Runtime 实现高效推理。</li>\n<li>ONNX 模型可通过<strong>算子融合、量化</strong>等技术进一步优化性能。</li>\n<li><strong>CoreML</strong> 是 Apple 生态的首选，能充分利用 Neural Engine 实现硬件加速。</li>\n<li>从 PyTorch 到 CoreML 的转换路径：PyTorch → TorchScript → coremltools → .mlpackage。</li>\n<li>部署平台的选择取决于目标硬件：Apple 用 CoreML，跨平台用 ONNX，NVIDIA 用 TensorRT。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CoreML 与 ONNX","id":"coreml-与-onnx"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台模型推理","id":"跨平台模型推理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ONNX 格式详解","id":"onnx-格式详解"},{"level":3,"text":"PyTorch → ONNX","id":"pytorch-onnx"},{"level":3,"text":"ONNX Runtime 推理","id":"onnx-runtime-推理"},{"level":2,"text":"ONNX 模型优化","id":"onnx-模型优化"},{"level":2,"text":"CoreML 转换","id":"coreml-转换"},{"level":3,"text":"CoreML 优化选项","id":"coreml-优化选项"},{"level":3,"text":"Apple 生态的端侧 LLM：MLX","id":"apple-生态的端侧-llm-mlx"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台推理对比","id":"跨平台推理对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模型序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/model-serialization"},"next":{"title":"TFLite 移动端部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/tflite-mobile"}}